flowchart LR
  S([Student]) -->|question| A
  subgraph AG[Python process: ExamAgent]
    A[Agent loop<br/>max 5 tool steps] <-->|chat + tool schemas| L[LLM adapter<br/>OpenAI-compatible<br/>or offline stand-in]
    P[System prompt<br/>role, scope, tool rules,<br/>evidence, memory, failure] --> A
    STM[(Short-term memory<br/>session window)] <--> A
    LTM[(Long-term memory<br/>SQLite ltm table<br/>+ vectors ltm:user)] <--> A
    A -->|search_notes| RAG[RAG<br/>chunk, embed, rank]
    RAG <--> VS[(Vector DB<br/>SQLite + NumPy cosine<br/>6 docs, 23 chunks)]
    A -->|MCP client| MC[MCP client<br/>official SDK, stdio]
  end
  KB[/Lecture notes<br/>data/knowledge/*.md/] -->|ingest| RAG
  MC <-->|JSON-RPC over stdio<br/>tools/list, tools/call| MS
  subgraph SRV[Separate process: MCP server]
    MS[study_tools_server.py] --> SD[(study.db<br/>quiz results, plans)]
  end
  A -->|answer + citations + trace| S
  S -->|confirm| A
